## Hard constraints

- NEVER modify production code (this task is read-only on workflow, write-only to brain/.git). Exception (2026-07-10, Kushal-approved): Part B2 may push ALREADY-COMMITTED work to origin via the PAT fallback — that is completing a deploy, not authoring changes.
- NEVER trigger missed tasks automatically — only flag for Kushal
- NEVER skip Slack notification — Kushal needs daily visibility on system health
- If git push fails 3 days in a row, escalate — likely remote-not-configured or auth issue

## Coordination

- Runs **after** all other daily tasks have had time to complete (Strategist's last run is 8 PM; this fires 11 PM with 3-hour buffer)
- Reads logs from all other tasks; nothing reads from this one's outputs (terminal node)
- Brain backup includes `brain/applied-changes/` so historical audit trail is preserved
